; The operator's own two loose things, set down on the desk where a man puts
; them (plan 8.10): his tin cup at his left hand by the pen tray, under the
; lamp, and the refill bottle behind the sounder at the inkwell end. Both are
; generated by tools/build_loose_prop_meshes.gd, base at the origin, and sit on
; the wood at 0.75. They are the room's only rigid bodies; their own physics
; layer (loose_prop.gd) keeps them out of the interaction ray.
;
; Masses are 1894 objects, not game units — see scripts/physics/push_impulse.gd
; for why one walk nudges both but only the lighter one skitters.
[node name="LooseProps" type="Node3D"]

; A tin cup, upright, 120 g. Its handle points along the desk toward the key,
; so the whole cup stays clear of the pen tray and inside the desk's edge.
